{"q": "$x&lt;y&lt;0$ olarsa, $\\sqrt{(2x+5y)^2}-\\sqrt[4]{(4x-y)^4}$ ifadəsini sadələşdirin.", "o": ["$-6x-4y$", "$-2x+6y$", "$2x-6y$", "$6x+4y$", "$-2x+4y$"], "a": 2, "e": "$\\sqrt{(2x+5y)^2}=|2x+5y|$, $\\sqrt[4]{(4x-y)^4}=|4x-y|$. $x,y&lt;0$ ⇒ $2x+5y&lt;0$; $4x-y=3x+(x-y)&lt;0$. Onda $-(2x+5y)-(y-4x)=-2x-5y-y+4x=2x-6y$.", "test": "Eyler Academy — Buraxılış Sınaq 2, XI sinif", "topic": "LOQ"}